    {
      "id": "Issue 10",
      "title": "Hamilton County – Proposed Tax Levy (Renewal and Increase): Children's Services",
      "summary": "Renews a 4.51-mill property tax and adds 1.1 mill, for a total of up to 5.61 mills for 4 years, to support children's services and the care and placement of children. The ballot language says this amounts to $121 for each $100,000 of county auditor's market value, and the county auditor estimates it will collect $116,888,718 a year. It would begin in 2026, first due in 2027.",
